		<p>
			<a href="https://github.com/ff6347/giclang/actions/runs/37739396171/artifacts/11533811272">
				GiC v0.9.0-beta.4 for Windows — unsigned test installer
			</a>
		</p>
		<p>
			This is a temporary GitHub Actions download, not a published release.
			GitHub sign-in is required, and the download expires. The archive includes
